Ravana hurls Maya and Saura weapons --- Rama destroys them with Gandharva arrows --- Rivals pierce each other in every limb --- Lakshmana severs banner beheads driver cuts bow --- Vibhishana smashes horses with a mace --- Lakshmana cuts Vibhishana-bound spear and saves him --- Ravana hurls unfailing spear into Lakshmana chest --- Rama breaks spear and entrusts Lakshmana to chiefs --- Rama vows a world without Ravana or Rama --- Rama batters and routs fleeing Ravana